WEBVTT

00:28.860 --> 00:31.000
Lands which I've yet to see...

00:32.200 --> 00:34.460
Races who I’ve yet to meet...

00:43.300 --> 00:45.100
A tomorrow which I’ve yet to experience...

00:46.300 --> 00:48.840
No matter what happens,

00:49.550 --> 00:51.050
I...

00:53.950 --> 00:56.150
will change the world!

01:11.250 --> 01:14.850
Here lies the land where Sinbad conquered the Dungeon.

01:15.350 --> 01:22.140
By doing so, he began his quest to find mysterious warriors across the world.

01:22.750 --> 01:28.250
Thus as many predicted, Dungeons began appearing throughout the lands.

01:28.250 --> 01:31.850
In short, the Era of Dungeon Conquerors has begun.

01:35.610 --> 01:39.030
Magi: Sinbad no Bouken <b>・</b> Part 1

01:42.000 --> 01:45.700
And so, Sinbad the Conqueror is now…

01:51.050 --> 01:52.730
drifting.

02:01.500 --> 02:03.700
Big Bro!

02:03.700 --> 02:06.250
This is your final chance! This time, for sure!

02:08.850 --> 02:10.170
From below?!

02:30.770 --> 02:32.040
Damn it!

02:39.950 --> 02:41.950
It's going to catch up.

02:52.200 --> 02:53.550
This way!

02:54.800 --> 02:56.430
If I don’t take him down here,

02:56.770 --> 02:58.700
I won’t reach adulthood.

02:58.700 --> 03:04.750
I’ll kill him… with the one shot I have!

03:07.200 --> 03:08.450
No more…

03:08.500 --> 03:10.500
Staying like this…

03:11.450 --> 03:15.000
I don’t want that!

03:36.250 --> 03:38.140
Over here, you monster!

03:39.950 --> 03:40.950
Baal!

03:41.550 --> 03:43.900
Lend me your power!

03:46.850 --> 03:49.500
Fall, Thunder!

04:04.000 --> 04:06.800
S-So cold…

04:13.400 --> 04:14.700
Iceberg up ahead!

04:14.950 --> 04:16.760
What a major setback!

04:16.760 --> 04:20.550
With the number of icebergs emerging, we should reduce our speed.

04:20.550 --> 04:21.150
No.

04:21.550 --> 04:22.900
Continue full speed ahead.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.280
You summoned me?

04:27.280 --> 04:29.280
Dragul.

04:29.480 --> 04:34.540
His Majesty is enraged by the matter concerning the Dungeon.

04:34.540 --> 04:39.750
Also, Serendine-sama has been shamed thanks to Sinbad.

04:41.000 --> 04:44.850
Normally, you would have been stripped of your military position.

04:45.200 --> 04:51.700
However, Safu General Barbarossa-sama has ensured that His Majesty give you at least the rank of a watchdog.

04:51.700 --> 04:52.700
Big Brother has…

04:59.600 --> 05:04.680
Partevia’s pride, the assassins of Sham Lash.

05:05.200 --> 05:11.000
Take these men with you and deliver Sinbad’s vessel to His Majesty.

05:16.000 --> 05:19.850
Furthermore, about Sinbad’s whereabouts...

05:20.850 --> 05:23.870
He heads northward.

05:24.520 --> 05:27.570
You are forbidden to fail again. Now go!

05:27.850 --> 05:29.650
I will stake my very life on it.

05:32.100 --> 05:33.530
If we move forward like this,

05:34.100 --> 05:36.380
we’ll arrive at Imuchakk.

05:37.200 --> 05:41.390
A remote region, home to a savage race of ill repute.

05:42.350 --> 05:43.950
Is he there?

05:57.050 --> 06:00.350
Woah, it really is huge!

06:01.150 --> 06:03.100
It’s called a Rampaging Unicorn.

06:03.550 --> 06:05.750
They usually live in the Southern seas

06:05.950 --> 06:09.250
but occasionally travel all the way up here.

06:09.950 --> 06:11.350
That’s amazing.

06:11.350 --> 06:14.250
And to think that you were trying to defeat it with one shot!

06:16.740 --> 06:17.840
Big Bro…

06:17.840 --> 06:19.500
You finally did it?

06:22.380 --> 06:23.690
You really did it!

06:25.000 --> 06:27.100
I knew you were better at more than just swimming!

06:27.100 --> 06:29.100
That's my Big Bro!

06:29.100 --> 06:30.290
Alright!

06:31.190 --> 06:33.420
Damn, I wanted to see it.

06:33.420 --> 06:35.420
But why is it burnt?

06:36.750 --> 06:37.690
And who are you?

06:38.400 --> 06:39.370
Me?

06:40.000 --> 06:41.350
I’m Sinbad.

06:41.750 --> 06:44.830
A woman’s beauty sure travels around the world, doesn't it?

06:51.650 --> 06:52.650
What’s your name?

06:52.850 --> 06:54.130
I’m Pipirika.

06:54.130 --> 06:56.130
Nice to meet you, Pipirika.

06:56.450 --> 06:57.450
And um…

06:57.450 --> 07:00.010
Come to think of it, I haven’t asked your name, have I?

07:02.950 --> 07:03.550
Hina.

07:03.850 --> 07:05.170
He’s called Hina.

07:06.000 --> 07:08.050
Big Bro is already 21 years old,

07:08.050 --> 07:09.790
but he still only has his given name.

07:09.790 --> 07:12.590
But now that you've defeated the Rampaging Unicorn,

07:12.590 --> 07:14.980
you’ll finally get a warrior’s name!

07:16.280 --> 07:18.950
With this, that person will acknowledge you too.

07:18.950 --> 07:19.950
That person?

07:20.650 --> 07:23.650
Strong, sweet… all women including myself admire her.

07:23.650 --> 07:27.100
After all, she’s Imuchakk’s number one beauty.

07:27.100 --> 07:28.180
Wow!

07:31.260 --> 07:33.950
What kind of a place is Imuchakk?

07:34.150 --> 07:36.480
What kind? Let’s see…

07:36.480 --> 07:38.180
It’s completely white.

07:38.180 --> 07:39.470
I don’t mean it like that…

07:39.470 --> 07:40.470
More like…

07:40.470 --> 07:42.830
What kind of leader does it have and such?

07:42.830 --> 07:45.180
Our father is the chief.

07:45.180 --> 07:45.980
Really?!

07:46.280 --> 07:49.880
Great! Take me there too.

07:50.250 --> 07:51.550
Sinbad…

07:51.780 --> 07:54.780
Our people don’t allow outsiders among us.

07:55.250 --> 07:57.470
I don’t think a lot of good will come of your visit.

07:57.470 --> 07:58.470
I don’t mind.

07:59.450 --> 08:00.450
Unknown lands...

08:00.850 --> 08:02.120
Unfamiliar people…

08:02.650 --> 08:04.750
I want to see the entire world…

08:05.250 --> 08:06.950
in order to change it!

08:15.050 --> 08:15.950
I…

08:17.100 --> 08:18.230
It’s beautiful, isn’t it?

08:20.650 --> 08:22.640
You've been gazing at this scene the entire time?

08:24.670 --> 08:25.390
Yes.

08:29.550 --> 08:30.650
I’m sorry.

08:32.180 --> 08:33.430
The Rampaging Unicorn.

08:33.600 --> 08:35.150
I stole your thunder.

08:36.400 --> 08:37.470
But you…

08:37.470 --> 08:39.750
You saved your little sister in an instant, didn’t you?

08:41.470 --> 08:42.730
That was cool.

08:46.450 --> 08:47.950
Was it?

08:53.580 --> 08:55.580
Pure white lands...

08:56.270 --> 08:57.850
A race that dwells in the Poles...

08:58.120 --> 08:59.970
Strange homes…

08:59.970 --> 09:02.970
And beautiful ladies too!

09:05.100 --> 09:07.780
Imuchakk is a country of snow and ice.

09:08.030 --> 09:10.010
Welcome back to you both,

09:12.850 --> 09:14.520
my children.

09:14.850 --> 09:16.050
Father!

09:16.920 --> 09:18.790
We have returned.

09:20.170 --> 09:21.620
And who are you?

09:21.620 --> 09:23.280
I’m Sinbad.

09:23.770 --> 09:26.150
I’m on an adventure to see the world—

09:27.320 --> 09:28.850
This is Imuchakk.

09:29.270 --> 09:31.420
This is no place for outsiders!

09:31.420 --> 09:32.380
Father…

09:32.930 --> 09:34.730
Sinbad is our—

09:34.730 --> 09:38.740
My son, now you’ve finally become a warrior.

09:39.080 --> 09:40.670
From this moment forward,

09:40.670 --> 09:43.780
this clan—this village—needs your protection from enemies.

09:45.630 --> 09:46.810
Remember that.

09:48.120 --> 09:48.850
Yes…

09:50.870 --> 09:53.050
Tonight will be the Maharagan!

09:53.050 --> 09:55.490
Come, it is time to prepare for the festival!

09:58.670 --> 09:59.170
Now then…

10:00.630 --> 10:03.750
Sinbad has entered the village of Imuchakk.

10:03.750 --> 10:04.910
This has become rather troublesome.

10:05.200 --> 10:08.630
The people of Sham Lash have already begun to take action.

10:09.930 --> 10:11.160
Doing as they please!

10:11.650 --> 10:13.950
They are people of darkness.

10:14.220 --> 10:16.170
You can’t tame them.

10:16.950 --> 10:18.670
Also...

10:25.200 --> 10:27.180
What’s a Maharagan?

10:27.550 --> 10:30.720
It’s a traditional Imuchakk festival.

10:30.720 --> 10:36.850
It used to be a coming-of-age ceremony to receive a warrior’s name and rank

10:36.850 --> 10:40.750
and also a ritual to thank the Goddess of the Sea.

10:40.750 --> 10:42.820
Now that you’ve defeated the Rampaging Unicorn, Big Bro,

10:42.820 --> 10:44.150
along with having your name,

10:44.150 --> 10:45.870
you’ll become a real warrior!

10:46.930 --> 10:49.820
In truth, during the time you two were gone,

10:49.820 --> 10:52.230
strange things appeared.

10:52.630 --> 10:53.780
Strange things?

10:54.430 --> 10:59.690
A building which I have never seen before has appeared farther up north.

10:59.690 --> 11:03.690
It’s the perfect place to choose new warriors.

11:04.300 --> 11:06.800
Hina, you shall also go and conquer—

11:06.800 --> 11:07.840
You can’t!

11:08.780 --> 11:10.780
You can’t get close to that.

11:10.970 --> 11:11.770
What?

11:12.090 --> 11:13.750
That’s a Dungeon.

11:14.300 --> 11:16.200
In my country Partevia,

11:16.200 --> 11:19.610
a building like that appeared as well and many people died.

11:19.900 --> 11:20.900
I’ve heard of it too.

11:20.900 --> 11:25.560
All the soldiers who entered were annihilated

11:25.560 --> 11:28.620
and it was eventually conquered by a single young man.

11:30.000 --> 11:31.100
That was me.

11:33.000 --> 11:34.770
What are you trying to say?

11:34.770 --> 11:38.120
I won’t forgive anyone who makes a fool of us.

11:46.200 --> 11:49.550
Is that what they call a Conqueror's Sign?

11:49.870 --> 11:51.450
Yes, that's right.

11:51.780 --> 11:54.100
The Djinn of that Dungeon resides in it.

11:58.470 --> 12:03.710
It is customary in Imachakk to ensure that the strong receive the finest hospitality.

12:03.710 --> 12:05.820
Please forgive my rude behavior up until now.

12:14.830 --> 12:17.250
It’s only natural to be wary of strangers.

12:17.630 --> 12:21.960
All the more when you’re the chief who looks out for his entire clan.

12:22.970 --> 12:24.810
That’s why I’d like to make a request.

12:25.300 --> 12:28.100
Don’t allow anyone close to that Dungeon.

12:28.350 --> 12:29.500
I understand.

12:29.500 --> 12:30.970
You have my word.

12:31.200 --> 12:34.990
Oh. Big Bro, have you already spoken with that person?

12:35.570 --> 12:36.970
No, I’m…

12:37.350 --> 12:39.500
You’re a warrior now.

12:39.500 --> 12:40.730
You should quickly tell that person too.

12:40.730 --> 12:41.730
Stop it!

12:41.990 --> 12:43.490
Right now, a person like me…

12:43.800 --> 12:45.980
Big Bro, what’s wrong?

12:46.380 --> 12:47.360
It’s started!

12:47.360 --> 12:48.410
Hurry!

12:51.250 --> 12:53.800
Come! Now is the time for the Maharagan,

12:53.800 --> 12:58.090
the celebration of a man becoming a warrior and time to show our thanks to the Goddess of the Sea.

13:28.850 --> 13:30.970
Now that you’ve defeated the Rampaging Unicorn, Big Bro,

13:30.970 --> 13:32.350
along with having your name,

13:32.350 --> 13:34.570
you’ll become a real warrior!

13:35.700 --> 13:36.830
You’re wrong.

13:36.830 --> 13:39.720
I heard he ran away from the Rampaging Unicorn again.

13:39.720 --> 13:44.030
I’m sorry. I can’t go out with a man who isn’t a warrior.

13:44.030 --> 13:47.260
What, did you fail again?

13:47.260 --> 13:50.270
You will become a warrior. You’re the Chief’s son, aren’t you?

13:50.270 --> 13:52.870
You can definitely defeat it, Big Brother!

13:53.850 --> 13:54.850
My son.

13:54.850 --> 13:56.970
Hurry and become a warrior.

13:58.670 --> 13:59.870
I…

14:00.670 --> 14:01.700
Big Bro.

14:02.790 --> 14:06.560
You always come here when you have something on your mind, don't you?

14:09.650 --> 14:11.350
This sure brings back memories.

14:12.550 --> 14:14.850
Wow, that’s so good!

14:15.550 --> 14:17.100
Pipirika, you wanna give it a go?

14:17.450 --> 14:18.650
I’m fine.

14:18.850 --> 14:20.750
You’ll get better once you practice.

14:20.750 --> 14:22.510
I can teach you.

14:22.510 --> 14:24.100
Okay!

14:24.100 --> 14:27.450
But you know, I want to watch you do it, Big Bro!

14:28.350 --> 14:29.370
Sure.

14:30.780 --> 14:32.480
Now that you’re a warrior,

14:32.480 --> 14:35.390
you must have a lot on your mind.

14:36.100 --> 14:36.880
But you know,

14:37.350 --> 14:41.770
even though you're a warrior, you'll always be the same kindhearted Big Bro, right?

14:42.550 --> 14:43.350
Let’s go.

14:43.650 --> 14:45.650
Tonight is your festival.

14:45.980 --> 14:47.020
Right.

14:47.020 --> 14:47.690
Come on!

14:48.550 --> 14:52.100
If we don’t hurry, Father will get Sinbad drunk!

14:59.350 --> 15:01.710
Huh? Where’s Sinbad?

15:02.150 --> 15:06.150
His threshold for alcohol is low so he’s resting now.

15:06.150 --> 15:08.550
You gave him too much to drink, didn’t you?

15:08.550 --> 15:10.270
What are you saying?

15:10.270 --> 15:13.180
If a man can’t hold his alcohol, then what will become of him?

15:14.800 --> 15:15.950
What’s wrong?

15:16.400 --> 15:17.310
Can you take it?

15:17.880 --> 15:20.550
This is a special sort of brew, you know.

15:25.550 --> 15:27.550
You’re so beautiful…

15:28.400 --> 15:30.100
But hang on…

15:30.800 --> 15:31.480
So tall…

15:31.480 --> 15:33.620
That’s our target.

15:33.620 --> 15:36.620
Ah, wait…

15:36.620 --> 15:38.620
Piece of cake.

15:39.370 --> 15:40.270
Die!

15:41.450 --> 15:43.450
Wait!

15:51.980 --> 15:52.980
A kid?

15:54.300 --> 15:57.300
Naughty children need to be disciplined properly!

16:04.850 --> 16:06.350
Is that all?

16:06.350 --> 16:09.250
As I thought, I’m more than enough to finish the job.

16:10.770 --> 16:11.570
What?

16:11.850 --> 16:13.450
What are you smiling about?

16:13.800 --> 16:15.380
Too bad.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.410
Now then.

16:26.800 --> 16:28.350
Who are you?

16:28.700 --> 16:30.230
Are you a member of Partevia’s troops?

16:31.100 --> 16:32.250
This brat!

16:32.850 --> 16:35.850
To think they would involve even a kid like you.

16:37.250 --> 16:38.040
Hey!

16:38.350 --> 16:39.800
What’s with that attitude?

16:40.400 --> 16:42.100
And at your age on top of that.

16:42.400 --> 16:44.200
I don’t know who your superiors are

16:44.420 --> 16:45.900
but your parents will be sad, won’t they?

16:46.000 --> 16:47.000
Shut up.

16:47.300 --> 16:48.300
What did you say?

16:48.850 --> 16:51.650
That’s some attitude towards people older than you.

16:51.650 --> 16:56.050
Sinbad, he’s an assassin. Be careful.

16:56.050 --> 16:57.180
I know.

16:57.330 --> 17:00.450
That’s why I’m asking him firsthand, right?

17:01.430 --> 17:03.370
N-No, that’s not what I meant…

17:03.370 --> 17:07.650
No. You gotta teach brats like him everything from the basics.

17:08.280 --> 17:09.210
You got that?

17:09.820 --> 17:13.480
You think you can talk like that just because you’re an assassin?

17:14.150 --> 17:16.900
Don’t you think your mom and dad will be disappointed?

17:17.250 --> 17:19.210
That’s why I told you to shut up!

17:19.460 --> 17:21.460
My parents are long gone!

17:21.460 --> 17:24.060
I killed them when I was six after all!

17:25.850 --> 17:28.510
What? You scared now?

17:30.650 --> 17:33.280
Don’t you dare say such things so proudly.

17:35.500 --> 17:36.500
I pity you.

17:44.030 --> 17:44.930
What’s with you?

17:45.200 --> 17:46.400
Those eyes…

17:46.880 --> 17:50.580
You’re a kid yourself, you asshole!

17:53.580 --> 17:54.580
Sinbad!

17:54.580 --> 17:55.480
You little…!

17:58.420 --> 17:59.670
Don’t come any closer!

18:01.430 --> 18:03.310
As if you could understand...

18:10.250 --> 18:12.730
Chief, are you unharmed?

18:12.730 --> 18:13.730
Shut up!

18:16.590 --> 18:19.380
I’ll definitely kill you!

18:19.380 --> 18:21.900
Sinbad!

18:22.350 --> 18:24.250
Just who were those guys…

18:24.800 --> 18:26.620
Is that wound you got okay?

18:26.620 --> 18:28.410
It’s nothing serious.

18:28.780 --> 18:31.320
Come on, let's hurry and get ready for the festival.

18:31.320 --> 18:34.000
More importantly, who were those guys?

18:34.000 --> 18:36.350
Probably some people from the Partevian Army.

18:36.350 --> 18:38.010
They’re after me.

18:38.010 --> 18:41.400
Isn’t that something you shouldn’t take lightly?

18:41.400 --> 18:42.250
Why?

18:42.250 --> 18:44.400
Because I defied the country.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.960
And some other stuff.

18:46.400 --> 18:48.000
Aren’t you afraid?

18:48.550 --> 18:51.350
You can’t return to your country and your life is being targeted.

18:51.350 --> 18:54.040
This could last for the rest of your life, you know.

18:54.040 --> 18:55.000
For me,

18:55.350 --> 18:57.450
I only follow my own destiny. That's it.

18:58.700 --> 18:59.650
Also,

19:00.100 --> 19:02.520
I will overcome this wave.

19:05.720 --> 19:06.350
Sin…

19:09.000 --> 19:10.000
I…

19:11.370 --> 19:13.270
Just a little bit more!

19:13.670 --> 19:16.000
Big Bro, it’s time!

19:17.450 --> 19:19.050
Could you go on ahead before me?

19:19.650 --> 19:22.670
I’d like to calm down for a bit.

19:23.750 --> 19:24.890
I see.

19:24.890 --> 19:26.080
Come as soon as you can, okay?

19:26.080 --> 19:27.680
We’ll see you later.

19:34.750 --> 19:36.930
Come on, hurry up! We’ll be late!

19:37.970 --> 19:39.270
Sinbad!

19:41.970 --> 19:42.970
Big Bro has…

19:44.750 --> 19:45.800
Big Bro…

19:45.800 --> 19:48.570
In order to be a real warrior…

19:49.000 --> 19:51.000
He said he’s going to the Dungeon!

19:52.300 --> 19:53.630
Will I become a warrior?

19:54.300 --> 19:56.850
If I obtain the power of the Dungeon,

19:57.350 --> 19:59.450
I’ll be just like you.

20:03.580 --> 20:06.670
Everyone except one who wants to be king will be slaughtered.

20:06.670 --> 20:07.980
That’s how the Dungeon works.

20:08.850 --> 20:11.950
To achieve their ambitions, many men tried

20:11.950 --> 20:14.010
and died in the process.

20:14.650 --> 20:16.450
Then, Big Bro…

20:16.750 --> 20:17.750
Don’t worry.

20:18.180 --> 20:20.240
I won’t let Hina die.

20:20.650 --> 20:21.450
But!

20:21.800 --> 20:24.800
Whether you come back alive or not…

20:24.800 --> 20:27.000
We can't be certain of that, right?

20:28.600 --> 20:29.930
I know this:

20:32.250 --> 20:35.200
I will not die.

20:48.350 --> 20:49.250
This is…

20:57.250 --> 20:58.350
Don’t lose heart.

20:59.050 --> 21:00.250
Even I…

21:03.650 --> 21:05.970
If I obtain the power of the Dungeon,

21:05.970 --> 21:08.130
then I’ll finally become a warrior.

21:08.420 --> 21:10.730
I will have everyone acknowledge me.

21:14.930 --> 21:16.230
This is…

21:22.670 --> 21:23.670
Where am I?

21:32.850 --> 21:34.480
This is…

21:35.680 --> 21:37.720
A Dungeon?

21:48.350 --> 21:53.480
Have your travels been led by the Dungeons, Sinbad?

21:54.750 --> 21:59.740
What do your eyes see all the way up there?

23:36.670 --> 23:38.380
Sinbad…

23:38.850 --> 23:41.450
Is this your fate?

23:41.820 --> 23:42.820
I’ll do it.

23:44.650 --> 23:48.530
I won’t… let anyone interfere.
